{"viewport_width": 1200}
{"type": "text", "id": "heading_this_is_a_web_page", "source_ids": ["src_00001"], "x": 320.0, "y": 32.0, "z": 1, "w": 560.0, "h": 24.0, "display": "block", "text": "This is a web page.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "32px", "fontWeight": "700", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_theres_not_much_here", "source_ids": ["src_00002"], "x": 320.0, "y": 77.44, "z": 2, "w": 560.0, "h": 24.0, "display": "block", "text": "There's not much here.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_just_words", "source_ids": ["src_00003"], "x": 320.0, "y": 117.44, "z": 3, "w": 560.0, "h": 24.0, "display": "block", "text": "Just words.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_weve_become_obsessed", "source_ids": ["src_00005"], "x": 320.0, "y": 197.44, "z": 4, "w": 560.0, "h": 48.0, "display": "block", "text": "We've become obsessed with fancy designs, responsive layouts, and scripts that do magical things.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_i_wrote_these_words", "source_ids": ["src_00007"], "x": 320.0, "y": 301.44, "z": 5, "w": 560.0, "h": 24.0, "display": "block", "text": "I wrote these words, and you're reading them: magical.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_im_in_a_little_city", "source_ids": ["src_00008"], "x": 320.0, "y": 341.44, "z": 6, "w": 560.0, "h": 72.0, "display": "block", "text": "I'm in a little city in British Columbia; you're probably somewhere else. I wrote this early in the morning, June 20th, 2013; you're reading it at a different time. I wrote this on my laptop; you could be reading this on your phone, a tablet or a desktop.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_you_and_i_have_been_able", "source_ids": ["src_00009"], "x": 320.0, "y": 429.44, "z": 7, "w": 560.0, "h": 72.0, "display": "block", "text": "You and I have been able to connect because and . Despite our different locations, devices, and time-zones we can connect on a simple HTML page.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_i_wrote_this_in_a_text_editor", "source_ids": ["src_00010"], "x": 320.0, "y": 517.44, "z": 8, "w": 560.0, "h": 72.0, "display": "block", "text": "I wrote this in a text editor. It's 6 kB. I didn't need a Content Management System, a graphic designer, or a software developer. There's not much code on this page at all: just simple markup for paragraphs, hierarchy, and emphasis.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_i_remember_teaching", "source_ids": ["src_00011"], "x": 320.0, "y": 605.44, "z": 9, "w": 560.0, "h": 120.0, "display": "block", "text": "I remember teaching my daughter to code HTML when she was 8. The first thing she wrote was . She wasn't \"writing HTML\"; . She couldn't believe that she could write a story on our home computer, and then publish it for the world to see. She didn't care about HTML; she cared about sharing her stories.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "link_a_story_about_a_squirrel", "source_ids": ["src_00012"], "x": 389.31, "y": 632.44, "z": 10, "w": 146.63, "h": 18.0, "display": "block", "text": "a story about a squirrel", "link": "https://justinjackson.ca/squirrel", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 238)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 238)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_think_about_all_the_things", "source_ids": ["src_00014"], "x": 320.0, "y": 781.44, "z": 11, "w": 560.0, "h": 96.0, "display": "block", "text": "Think about all the things you could communicate with a simple page like this. If you're a businessperson, you could sell something. If you're a teacher, you could teach something. If you're an artist, you could show something you've made.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_if_youre_a_web_designer", "source_ids": ["src_00015"], "x": 320.0, "y": 893.44, "z": 12, "w": 560.0, "h": 48.0, "display": "block", "text": "If you're a web designer, I challenge you to think about the words first. Instead of starting with a style guide or a Photoshop mockup, .", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_what_do_you_have_to_say", "source_ids": ["src_00016"], "x": 320.0, "y": 957.44, "z": 13, "w": 560.0, "h": 120.0, "display": "block", "text": "What do you have to say? If you don't know, there's not much use in adding all that other cruft. , with a single focus. Write it and publish it, and then . Every time you're about to add something, ask yourself: does this help me communicate better? Will that additional styling, image, or hyperlink give my audience more understanding? If the answer is \"no,\" don't add it.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_words_dont_come_after", "source_ids": ["src_00017"], "x": 320.0, "y": 1093.44, "z": 14, "w": 560.0, "h": 48.0, "display": "block", "text": ". Words don't come the design is done. Words are the beginning, the core, the focus.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
{"type": "text", "id": "text_start_with_words", "source_ids": ["src_00018"], "x": 320.0, "y": 1157.44, "z": 15, "w": 560.0, "h": 24.0, "display": "block", "text": "Start with words.", "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)", "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)", "fontFamily": "Times", "fontSize": "16px", "fontWeight": "400", "textAlign": "left", "border": "0px none rgb(0, 0, 0)", "borderRadius": "0px", "padding": "0px"}
